Not!

First: no alignment is lost by donning or trying to don a HoA.

Secondly: when you don HoA you always lose your protection. If you do 
this in Quest however the HoA will not autocurse as you are not wearing 
it (the message you get states that you don't actually don it).

However, changing alignment using HoA does not mean that you cannot do 
your Quest. You only have to get the helm removed somehow and you return 
to your original alignment. However the removing of HoA removes all 
protection you might have gained since donning it.

Changing your permanent alignment by offering on a crossaligned altar 
will cause the inability to do the Quest unless you've already granted 
the entrance from the home-level downwards.

